# rf-adapt-intel (minimal)

Quick build steps (run from your user shell):

1) Ensure you are in the project directory:
   cd ~/rf-adapt-intel

2) Create the build directory and run CMake:
   mkdir -p build
   cd build
   cmake ..
   make -j$(nproc)

3) Run the program:
   ./rf_adapt_intel

This minimal version depends only on sqlite3 dev files. Once this builds, you can replace src/main.cpp with the full SoapySDR + liquid-dsp implementation and update CMakeLists.txt to link Soapy/liquid (the TODOs are included in CMakeLists.txt).